WEBVTT

00:00:58.083 --> 00:01:01.375
"My dead son in my arms?"

00:01:02.292 --> 00:01:04.976
Doesn't the old man know
that the bodies of the dead

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.726
are worthless?

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.851
His quest pointless.

00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:12.833
Who would risk their life for a corpse?

00:01:14.292 --> 00:01:18.559
The story comes from Book 24
of "The Iliad,"

00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:21.934
a foundation work of Western civilization

00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:25.768
written by Homer in 700 BC

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:31.309
about a war that took place in 1300 BC.